Description:
OS-level application sandboxing library.

Local Modifications:
The crates (1) live in third_party/gaol/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/gaol/ unchanged.

Crates:
